    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þæt is þonon ærest, þæt hig gecwædon, þæt cyricgrið binnan wagum ⁊ cyninges handgrið stande efne unwemme.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Next after this, they declared that sanctuary within the walls of a church, and the protection granted by the king in person, shall remain equally inviolate.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þæt is þonon ærest, þæt hig gecwædon, þæt cyricgrið binnan wagum ⁊ cyninges handgrið stande efne unwemne.</ab>
      </div>
